klahoma/latimer-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids. In 2025 that pair ran 46% of normal on the middle of the grids, and April to May ran 180% in 2025. Grids 17840 and 17841 had their driest year in 1963, at 44% of normal.</p>"}
